---
import { sitePath } from "../../utils/paths";
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Research" active="Research"><section class="container page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Research</p><h1>Biological systems,<br/><span>one molecule at a time.</span></h1><p class="lead">Molecular simulation is the common thread in my work: understanding membrane behavior, exploring molecular interactions, and developing computational workflows.</p></section><section class="container research-list"><a class="research-row" href={sitePath("/research/electroporation/")}><span class="row-number">01</span><div><p class="eyebrow">Membrane biophysics</p><h2>Electroporation &<br/>molecular transport</h2><p>How can electric pulses influence the formation and lifetime of membrane pores?</p><span class="text-link">Explore the research →</span></div><img src={sitePath("/images/electroporation-figure-4.webp")} alt="Membrane pore snapshots at successive times" loading="lazy"/></a><a class="research-row" href={sitePath("/research/semdock/")}><span class="row-number">02</span><div><p class="eyebrow">Protein–small-molecule interactions</p><h2>Virtual screening &<br/>reproducible workflows</h2><p>How can raw chemical collections become a practical starting point for molecular docking?</p><span class="text-link">Explore the research →</span></div><img src={sitePath("/images/semdock-abstract.webp")} alt="Graphical overview of semdock" loading="lazy"/></a><a class="research-row" href={sitePath("/research/molecular-transport/")}><span class="row-number">03</span><div><p class="eyebrow">Membrane biophysics · First-author research</p><h2>From pore formation<br/>to molecular transport</h2><p>Connecting atomistic simulations with quantitative diffusion modeling.</p><span class="text-link">Explore the research →</span></div><img src={sitePath("/images/transport-figure-2.webp")} alt="Molecular snapshots of electropore formation" loading="lazy"/></a></section></Base>
